  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186115299,
      "id": "f9469d5c-e097-590c-8ddb-2c7fda353fac",
      "title": "Classifying a System as Consistent Dependent, Consistent Independent, or Inconsistent"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "61d1e701-5efb-5f15-9a53-f400e5120cfc",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-3y-3z &=-1 \\\\ x-2y-6z &=-6 \\\\ 2x-5y-10z &=-9\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The system is consistent dependent\n- **II.** The system is consistent independent\n- **III.** The system is inconsistent",
      ":question/worked-solution": "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -2 & -6 & -6 \\\\ 2 & -5 & -10 & -9\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -2 & -6 & -6 \\\\ 2 & -5 & -10 & -9\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -5 \\\\ 2 & -5 & -10 & -9\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -4 & -7\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{2} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & -2\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThere is a pivot for each variable and no contradictory row. The system has a unique solution, so we conclude that the system is consistent independent.\n\nAs a result, only statement II is true.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "1e13d412-00eb-57d2-a33e-d040f2397bb9",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
